  "steps": [
   "The scheduler starts the batch (job chain F12 -> F11 -> F08).",
   "Delete all rows of TB_R_H0253_ORDER_CANCEL_PRE (NSP) and insert the rows of TB_R_H0253_ORDER_CONTROL_PRE (DB Surrounding) with ORDER_STATUS = '2' (same columns and values). No NSP-only column: the cancel result is kept by F11 in its own table.",
   "No error: commit. Error: roll back step 2 (one transaction). Record the result in the Log. Exit."
  ]
